      </div>

      <h3 class="dia-h">One dial, every setting</h3>
      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why"><b>Precise heat</b><span>180–320 °C to the degree. Lower for blonde leaf, higher for dark.</span></div>
        <div class="why"><b>Custom pre-heat</b><span>0–15 minutes before the first draw. Default 7 min at 275 °C.</span></div>
